2026-04-18T07:57:15-04:00","message":"(chore) Update OpenMRS dependencies (#534)","refs":"","body":"","authorName":"openmrs-bot","authorEmail":"infrastructure@openmrs.org"},{"hash":"91a6af5cdb94d51894975648f75dc7d805701a02","date":"2026-04-18T12:53:08+03:00","message":"(chore) Update OpenMRS dependencies","refs":"","body":"Bumps @openmrs/esm-framework, @openmrs/esm-styleguide, and openmrs to\n9.0.3-pre.4550. The new framework's dist/index.d.ts re-exports from\n@openmrs/esm-globals/src/public, which under classic \"node\" module\nresolution resolves to the source .ts file. That file redeclares\n__webpack_share_scopes__, conflicting with the declaration in\nesm-globals/dist/types.d.ts and breaking `yarn typescript`.\n\nSwitch moduleResolution to \"bundler\" so the exports map is honored and\nthe subpath resolves to dist/public.d.ts. Mirrors the fix applied in\nopenmrs-esm-patient-chart#3235.\n","authorName":"denniskigen","authorEmail":"kigen.work@gmail.com"}],"totalCount":160}"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"40a34c9b-a8cb-4562-a2f3-2e3e0e53d063","uuid":"284e45c4-7049-46e4-ba50-055d1adcfa7b","timestamp":"2026-10-24T04:13:16.265Z","tool_use_result":[{"type":"text","text":"{"commits":[{"hash":"28fa65e5ef76502c1d11a3401b2fe7e65b674924","date":"2026-07-14T10:12:42-04:00","message":"(chore) Update OpenMRS dependencies (#590)","refs":"","body":"","authorName":"openmrs-bot","authorEmail":"infrastructure@openmrs.org"},{"hash":"eb8bb79c55d3b05a298f9cd765212485c9c3340a","date":"2026-07-10T16:55:25-04:00","message":"(chore) Update OpenMRS dependencies (#589)","refs":"","body":"","authorName":"openmrs-bot","authorEmail":"infrastructure@openmrs.org"},{"hash":"53dd2f2f6770092550318f410b2e37d02cd472b8","date":"2026-07-09T18:02:20-04:00","message":"(chore) Update OpenMRS dependencies (#588)","refs":"","body":"","authorName":"openmrs-bot","authorEmail":"infrastructure@openmrs.org"},{"hash":"5c9b71e3214c8039fca5dad6f5ccddd94bd28773","date":"2026-07-09T17:03:32-04:00","mess